usage: run.py [-h] [-r] [-n NAME] [-l LOG]
              config_file_list [config_file_list ...]

positional arguments:
  config_file_list      Name of config file (eg: person_v1 for
                        config/person_v1.json/yaml), or full path if it is not
                        in config folder, you can pass multiple config files
                        and run them all sequentially

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  -r, --recover         Continue running additional jobs even if a job fails
  -n NAME, --name NAME  Name to replace [name] tag in config file, useful for
                        shared config file
  -l LOG, --log LOG     Log file to write output to
